Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 20:41:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] audio: a filter that hands the samples to a callback

---
 audio/filter/af_flextap.c | 90 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 filters/user_filters.c    |  1 +
 filters/user_filters.h    |  1 +
 include/mpv/client.h      | 11 +++++
 meson.build               |  1 +
 5 files changed, 104 insertions(+)
